title: Democratic Internal Security
subtitle: The coercive state is easier to inherit than to reform.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and interior_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_internal_security_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_internal_security_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/oversight-delivery.webp

= Democratic Internal Security

Police commanders want continuity, civil-rights groups want files opened and
the coalition wants every security dispute kept out of the evening news. The
Interior Ministry can make democratic control more than a slogan.

- @democratic_vetting
- @protect_targets
- @threat_assessment

@democratic_vetting
title: Fund vetting, training and civilian oversight
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Reform the institution rather than its press office.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Regional training and independent oversight require one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; police_trust += 6; constitutional_restraint += 4; public_trust += 3; government_procedural_restraint += 2; government_coalition_dissent += 3; news_headline = "The Interior Ministry places police reform under civilian oversight"

Promotions, complaints and crowd-control doctrine receive published standards.
Commanders call it mistrust. The ministry replies that accountable authority
is the only kind a democratic government should want.

- #poland_card_finish


@protect_targets
title: Concentrate on hate crime and far-right violence
subtitle: Redirect existing capacity toward people the state has too often ignored.
on-arrival: minority_safety += 5; far_right_agenda -= 3; police_trust += 2; public_trust += 1; national_security_backlash += 2; news_headline = "Police receive a national mandate against hate crime and far-right violence"

Specialist teams coordinate cases that had been treated as isolated local
incidents. The work builds trust among likely targets and gives the radical
right a ready-made story about political policing.

- #poland_card_finish


@threat_assessment
title: Publish a rights-tested national threat assessment
subtitle: No resource or budget cost. Make the ministry defend its priorities in public.
on-arrival: border_security_confidence += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; government_procedural_restraint += 2; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "The Interior Ministry publishes the evidence behind its security priorities"

The document distinguishes crime, extremism and migration instead of folding
them into one permanent emergency. It spends no new money, but makes the next
panic harder to govern by insinuation.

- #poland_card_finish
